002880*
002890 RUTINA.
           display "XPN-GRNBSDES-RUTINA".
      *    DISPLAY 'VERSIO FEBRERO 2020'.                               PRJ0211439
           DISPLAY 'VERSION MAYO 2022'.                                 PRJ0211439
002900*
002910     MOVE 'OK'                   TO   RUTDES-RESULT.
           PERFORM BUSCAR-INDI-CLAVES THRU FIN-BUSCAR-INDI-CLAVES.      CSSSGM
002930     IF   CAL-NA
002940     THEN PERFORM CALCULO-NA THRU FIN-CALCULO-NA
002950     ELSE IF    CAL-PA
002960          THEN  PERFORM CALCULO-PA THRU FIN-CALCULO-PA
002970          ELSE  IF    CAL-SUSTITUIR
002980                THEN  PERFORM CALCULO-NUE THRU FIN-CALCULO-NUE
002990                ELSE  IF    CAL-PIN
003000                      THEN  PERFORM CALCULO-PIN THRU
003010                                    FIN-CALCULO-PIN
003020                      ELSE  IF    CAL-CAMPIN
003030                            THEN  PERFORM CALCULO-PA
003040                                     THRU FIN-CALCULO-PA
003050                                  MOVE  RUTDES-OFFSET TO
003060                                        RUTDES-OFF-NUEVO
003070                                        RUTDES-OFF-VIEJO
003080*    <------------------------------
003090*    <------------------------------
003100*    <------------------------------
003110     ELSE  IF    VAL-PIN-CAJERO
003120           THEN  PERFORM VALIDAR-PIN-CAJ THRU FIN-VALIDAR-PIN-CAJ
003130           ELSE  IF    VAL-PIN-REDES
003140                 THEN  PERFORM VALIDAR-PIN-RED
003150                          THRU FIN-VALIDAR-PIN-RED
003160                 ELSE  IF    CAMBIO-CL-TRAN
003170                       THEN  PERFORM CAMBIAR-CLTR
003180                                THRU FIN-CAMBIAR-CLTR
003190                       ELSE  IF    CAL-CSS
003200                             THEN  PERFORM CALCULO-CSS
003210                                       THRU FIN-CALCULO-CSS
