      *    CALCULO DEL OFFSET A PARTIR DEL BLOQUE DE PIN ENVIADO        SAL92320
      *    POR EL CAJERO. VARIA SEGUN EL FORMATO DE BLOQUE DE PIN.      SAL92320
      *                                                                 SAL92320
       CALCULO-OFFSET.                                                  SAL92320
      ****************                                                  SAL92320
      *              
           display "XPN-GRNBSDES-CALCULO-OFFSET".                                                   

      **** OBTENCION PARA INVERSIS:
      ****
      ****  1.- SE DECIFRA EL PAN CON LA CLAVE DE TRANSPORTE
      ****     (inversis utiliza KTRAPIN-1, indice de busca = 02)
      ****  2.- EL VALOR OBTENIDO ES LA CLAVE DE DESCIFRE DE BPIN
      ****      DIVERSIFICADA POR PAN
      ****  3.- SE DESCIFRA EL BPIN CON LA CLAVE DE DESCIFRADO.
      ****  4.- SE CALCULA EL PIN ANTIGUO
      ****  5.- SE LE RESTA EL OFFSET 

           PERFORM LEER-PARAM  THRU FIN-LEER-PARAM.
      *
           MOVE  LOW-VALUES    TO     AREA-GRDESKEY.                    
           MOVE  RUTDES-PAN    TO     CADENA-DATOS.                     
           MOVE  DESCIFRAR     TO     OPERACION.                        
      ***l     DISPLAY 'GRNBSDES: DESENCRIPTANDO PAN'.
      *
      ***l     IF    PART-PIN-CIF-CLAVT1
      ***l     THEN  MOVE CLBECIFRA-PIN1    TO  INDICE-CLAVE
      ***l     ELSE  MOVE CLBECIFRA-PIN2    TO  INDICE-CLAVE.
      *
      **** inversis usa KTRAPIN-1 como clave para cambios de pin
      **** enviados desde 4B por banda--> indice 2
      *
           MOVE  K2X02              TO  INDICE-CLAVE.
      *
      ***** PRUEBAS EN INVERSIS: *******************
      *
      *    PONER EN INDICE CLAVE 16 (CLAVE CIFRADA DE PRUEBAS)
      *
      *****************************************************
      *
      ***l     DISPLAY 'VALOR DE INDICE:' INDICE-CLAVE.
      ***l     DISPLAY 'DATO ENTRADA EN INTDES:' CADENA-DATOS.
           CALL  'GRINTDES'    USING  AREA-GRDESKEY.                    SAL92320
           MOVE  ALDESCID-OUT  TO     WK-CHAR-16.                       SAL92320
      ***l     DISPLAY 'resultado de descifrado:' WK-CHAR-16.
      *
      ***l     DISPLAY 'DESCENCRIPTANDO BLOQUE PIN'.
           MOVE  LOW-VALUES    TO     AREA-GRDESKEY.                    
           MOVE  RUTDES-BPIN   TO     CADENA-DATOS.                     
           MOVE  WK-CHAR-16    TO     CADENA-CLAVE.
      ***l     DISPLAY 'CADENA-DATOS:' CADENA-DATOS.
      ***l     DISPLAY 'CADENA-CLAVE:' CADENA-CLAVE.
           MOVE  DESCIFRAR     TO     OPERACION.                        
           MOVE  ZERO          TO     INDICE-CLAVE.
      *
      ***l     DISPLAY 'VALOR DE INDICE:' INDICE-CLAVE.
           CALL  'GRINTDES'    USING  AREA-GRDESKEY.                    SAL92320
           MOVE  ALDESCID-OUT  TO     WK-CHAR-16.                       SAL92320
      ***l     DISPLAY 'RESULTADO DE DESCIFRE:' WK-CHAR-16.
      *                                                                 SAL92320
      ***l     DISPLAY 'RESULTADO DE INTDEES' ALDESCID-OUT.
      **** EL BLOQUE DE PIN PARA INVERSIS TIENE LA SIGUIENTE ESTRUCTURA INVERSIS
      **** 4 DIGITOS CON EL PIN TECLEADO POR EL CLIENTE Y 12 CARACTERES INVERSIS
      ***  DE RELLENO                                                   INVERSIS
      *                                                                 INVERSIS
           MOVE  WK-CHAR-16-1-4   TO     W-PIN.                         INVERSIS
      *
      ***l     DISPLAY 'LO QUE TECLEO EL SENNOR ES:' W-PIN.
           MOVE  LOW-VALUES       TO     AREA-GRDESKEY.                 SAL92320
           MOVE  RUTDES-PAN       TO     CADENA-DATOS.                  SAL92320
           MOVE  CIFRAR           TO     OPERACION.                     SAL92320
           MOVE  CLAVESMAES       TO     INDICE-CLAVE.                  SAL92320
           CALL  'GRINTDES'       USING  AREA-GRDESKEY.                 SAL92320
           MOVE  TABLADECMAES     TO     INDICE-CLAVE-TD.               SAL92320
           MOVE  ALDESCID-OUT     TO     DATODECIM.                     SAL92320
      *                                                                 SAL92320
           CALL  'GRINTTDE'       USING  AREA-GRGENTDE.                 SAL92320
           MOVE  ALDESCID-OUT-TD  TO     TABLA-DECIM.                   SAL92320
           PERFORM DECIMALIZAR    THRU   FIN-DECIMALIZAR                SAL92320
               VARYING  INDICE                                          SAL92320
                  FROM  1 BY 1                                          SAL92320
                 UNTIL  INDICE > 16.                                    SAL92320
      *                                                                 SAL92320
           PERFORM RESTAR-PIN     THRU   FIN-RESTAR-PIN                 SAL92320
               VARYING  INDICE                                          SAL92320
                  FROM  1 BY 1                                          SAL92320
                 UNTIL  INDICE > 4.                                     SAL92320
      *                                                                 SAL92320
           MOVE    W-PIN          TO     RUTDES-OFFSET.                 SAL92320
      *                                                            
      ***l     DISPLAY 'EL VALOR DE NUEVO OFFSET ES:' RUTDES-OFFSET.
      *
       FIN-CALCULO-OFFSET.                                              SAL92320
           EXIT.                                                        SAL92320
      *                                                                 SAL92320
      *                                                                 SAL92320
      **************************
       CALCULO-OFFSET-PIN-CLARO.
      **************************
      *
      *
           DISPLAY 'CALCULO-OFFSET-PIN-CLARO. RUTDES-PAN:' RUTDES-PAN.   
      *    DISPLAY 'CALCULO-OFFSET-PIN-CLARO. RUTDES-PIN:' RUTDES-BPIN.  
           DISPLAY 'CALCULO-OFFSET-PIN-CLARO. RUTDES-ISO-0:' 
           RUTDES-ISO-0. 
           MOVE  LOW-VALUES       TO     AREA-GRDESKEY.              
           MOVE  RUTDES-PAN       TO     CADENA-DATOS.               
           MOVE  CIFRAR           TO     OPERACION.                     SAL92320
           MOVE  CLAVESMAES       TO     INDICE-CLAVE.                  SAL92320
           CALL  'GRINTDES'       USING  AREA-GRDESKEY.                 SAL92320
      *
           MOVE  TABLADECMAES     TO     INDICE-CLAVE-TD.               SAL92320
           MOVE  ALDESCID-OUT     TO     DATODECIM.                     SAL92320
           CALL  'GRINTTDE'       USING  AREA-GRGENTDE.                 SAL92320
      *
           MOVE  ALDESCID-OUT-TD  TO     TABLA-DECIM.                   SAL92320
           PERFORM DECIMALIZAR    THRU   FIN-DECIMALIZAR                SAL92320
               VARYING  INDICE                                          SAL92320
                  FROM  1 BY 1                                          SAL92320
                 UNTIL  INDICE > 16.                                    SAL92320
      *                                                                 SAL92320
      *    MOVE    RUTDES-BPIN(1:4) TO     W-PIN.                       PRJ0211439
           MOVE    RUTDES-ISO-0(3:4) TO    W-PIN.                       PRJ0211439
           DISPLAY 'CALCULO-OFFSET-PIN-CLARO. W-PIN:' W-PIN.
           
           PERFORM RESTAR-PIN     THRU   FIN-RESTAR-PIN                 SAL92320
               VARYING  INDICE                                          SAL92320
                  FROM  1 BY 1                                          SAL92320
                 UNTIL  INDICE > 4.                                     SAL92320
      *                                                                 SAL92320
           MOVE    W-PIN          TO     RUTDES-OFFSET.                 SAL92320
      *                                                            
           DISPLAY 'CALCULO-OFFSET-PIN-CLARO. RUTDES-OFFSET:' 
                                              RUTDES-OFFSET.
      *
      *
      ******************************
       FIN-CALCULO-OFFSET-PIN-CLARO.
      ******************************
           EXIT.
      *
      *
      ***  Paso 1: 0249999FFFFFFFFF donde 9999 es el PIN                PRJ0144187
      ***  Paso 2: 0000999999999999 donde 999999999999 son las          PRJ0144187
      ***          posiciones 4 a 15 del PAN                            PRJ0144187
      ***  Paso 3: XOR del paso 1 y del paso 2                          PRJ0144187
      ***                                                               PRJ0144187
      ******************                                                PRJ0144187
       CALCULO-PIN-ISO0.                                                PRJ0144187
      ******************                                                PRJ0144187
      *                                                                 PRJ0144187
      *                                                                 PRJ0144187
           PERFORM     CALCULO-PIN      THRU    FIN-CALCULO-PIN.        PRJ0144187
           MOVE        K2U04            TO      WK-DATA1-A.             PRJ0144187
           MOVE        RUTDES-PIN       TO      WK-DATA1-B.             PRJ0144187
           MOVE        K10XF            TO      WK-DATA1-C.             PRJ0144187
           DISPLAY 'GRNBSDES. CALCULO-PIN-ISO0. WK-DATA1: ' WK-DATA1.   PRJ0144187
           MOVE        K4U0             TO      WK-DATA2-A.             PRJ0144187
           MOVE        RUTDES-PAN(4:12) TO      WK-DATA2-B.             PRJ0144187
           DISPLAY 'GRNBSDES. CALCULO-PIN-ISO0. WK-DATA2: ' WK-DATA2.   PRJ0144187
           MOVE        WK-DATA1         TO      WK-CHAR-16.             PRJ0144187
           MOVE        K1U1             TO      WK-INDICE.              PRJ0144187
           MOVE        K1U1             TO      WK-INDICE2.             PRJ0144187
           PERFORM     COMPRIMIR        THRU    FIN-COMPRIMIR           PRJ0144187
                                                8 TIMES.                PRJ0144187
           MOVE        WK-CHAR-8        TO      WK-BLOQ1-CSS.           PRJ0144187
      *                                                                 PRJ0144187
           MOVE        WK-DATA2         TO      WK-CHAR-16.             PRJ0144187
           MOVE        K1U1             TO      WK-INDICE.              PRJ0144187
           MOVE        K1U1             TO      WK-INDICE2.             PRJ0144187
           PERFORM     COMPRIMIR        THRU    FIN-COMPRIMIR           PRJ0144187
                                                8 TIMES.                PRJ0144187
           MOVE        WK-CHAR-8        TO      WK-BLOQ2-CSS.           PRJ0144187
      *                                                                 PRJ0144187
           PERFORM     HACER-XOR        THRU    FIN-HACER-XOR.          PRJ0144187
           MOVE        WK-BLOQ2-CSS     TO      WK-CHAR-8.              PRJ0144187
      *                                                                 PRJ0144187
      *                                                                 PRJ0144187
           MOVE        K1U1             TO      WK-INDICE.              PRJ0144187
           MOVE        K1U1             TO      WK-INDICE2.             PRJ0144187
           PERFORM     DESCOMPRIMIR     THRU    FIN-DESCOMPRIMIR        PRJ0144187
                                                8 TIMES.                PRJ0144187
           MOVE        WK-CHAR-16       TO      RUTDES-ISO-0.           PRJ0144187
           DISPLAY 'GRNBSDES. CALCULO-PIN-ISO0. RUTDES-ISO-0: '         PRJ0144187
                                                RUTDES-ISO-0.           PRJ0144187
      *                                                                 PRJ0144187
      *                                                                 PRJ0144187
      **********************                                            PRJ0144187
       FIN-CALCULO-PIN-ISO0.                                            PRJ0144187
      **********************                                            PRJ0144187
           EXIT.                                                        PRJ0144187
      *                                                                 PRJ0211439
      ***  Paso 1: PIN BLOCK                                            PRJ0211439
      ***  Paso 2: 0000999999999999 donde 999999999999 son las          PRJ0211439
      ***          posiciones 4 a 15 del PAN                            PRJ0211439
      ***  Paso 3: XOR del paso 1 y del paso 2                          PRJ0211439
      ***                                                               PRJ0211439
      ***********                                                       PRJ0211439
       VOY-A-XOR.                                                       PRJ0211439
      ***********                                                       PRJ0211439
      *                                                                 PRJ0211439
      *                                                                 PRJ0211439
           MOVE RUTDES-BPIN          TO      WK-DATA1.                  PRJ0211439
           DISPLAY 'GRNBSDES. VOY-A-XOR. WK-DATA1: ' WK-DATA1.          PRJ0211439
           MOVE        K4U0             TO      WK-DATA2-A.             PRJ0211439
           DISPLAY 'GRNBSDES. RUTDES-PAN:' RUTDES-PAN.
           MOVE       RUTDES-PAN(4:12)  TO      WK-DATA2-B.             PRJ0211439
           DISPLAY 'GRNBSDES. VOY-A-XOR.  WK-DATA2: ' WK-DATA2.         PRJ0211439
           MOVE        WK-DATA1         TO      WK-CHAR-16.             PRJ0211439
           MOVE        K1U1             TO      WK-INDICE.              PRJ0211439
           MOVE        K1U1             TO      WK-INDICE2.             PRJ0211439
           PERFORM     COMPRIMIR        THRU    FIN-COMPRIMIR           PRJ0211439
                                                8 TIMES.                PRJ0211439
           MOVE        WK-CHAR-8        TO      WK-BLOQ1-CSS.           PRJ0211439
      *                                                                 PRJ0211439
           MOVE        WK-DATA2         TO      WK-CHAR-16.             PRJ0211439
           MOVE        K1U1             TO      WK-INDICE.              PRJ0211439
           MOVE        K1U1             TO      WK-INDICE2.             PRJ0211439
           PERFORM     COMPRIMIR        THRU    FIN-COMPRIMIR           PRJ0211439
                                                8 TIMES.                PRJ0211439
           MOVE        WK-CHAR-8        TO      WK-BLOQ2-CSS.           PRJ0211439
      *                                                                 PRJ0211439
           PERFORM     HACER-XOR        THRU    FIN-HACER-XOR.          PRJ0211439
           MOVE        WK-BLOQ2-CSS     TO      WK-CHAR-8.              PRJ0211439
      *                                                                 PRJ0211439
      *                                                                 PRJ0211439
           MOVE        K1U1             TO      WK-INDICE.              PRJ0211439
           MOVE        K1U1             TO      WK-INDICE2.             PRJ0211439
           PERFORM     DESCOMPRIMIR     THRU    FIN-DESCOMPRIMIR        PRJ0211439
                                                8 TIMES.                PRJ0211439
           MOVE        WK-CHAR-16       TO      RUTDES-ISO-0.           PRJ0211439
           DISPLAY 'GRNBSDES. VOY-A-XOR. RUTDES-ISO-0: '                PRJ0211439
                                                RUTDES-ISO-0.           PRJ0211439
      *                                                                 PRJ0211439
      *                                                                 PRJ0211439
      ***************                                                   PRJ0211439
       FIN-VOY-A-XOR.                                                   PRJ0211439
      ***************                                                   PRJ0211439
           EXIT.                                                        PRJ0211439
      *
      *
008530 COMPRIMIR.
008540***********
008550*
           display "XPN-GRNBSDES-COMPRIMIR".

008560     IF    WK-ELEM-CHAR-16 ( WK-INDICE ) NUMERIC
008570     THEN  MOVE  WK-ELEM-CHAR-16 ( WK-INDICE) TO WK-MULT
008580     ELSE  IF    WK-ELEM-CHAR-16 ( WK-INDICE ) = K1XA
008590           THEN  MOVE  K2U10    TO  WK-MULT
008600           ELSE  IF    WK-ELEM-CHAR-16 ( WK-INDICE ) = K1XB
008610                 THEN  MOVE  K2U11    TO  WK-MULT
008620                 ELSE  IF    WK-ELEM-CHAR-16 ( WK-INDICE ) = K1XC
008630                       THEN  MOVE  K2U12    TO  WK-MULT
008640*     <------------------------------------------------
008650*     <------------------------------------------------
008660*     <------------------------------------------------
008670     ELSE  IF    WK-ELEM-CHAR-16 ( WK-INDICE ) = K1XD
008680           THEN  MOVE  K2U13    TO  WK-MULT
008690           ELSE  IF    WK-ELEM-CHAR-16 ( WK-INDICE ) = K1XE
008700                 THEN  MOVE  K2U14   TO  WK-MULT
008710                 ELSE  MOVE  K2U15   TO  WK-MULT.
008720*
008730     ADD  K1U1    TO  WK-INDICE.
008740*
008750     IF    WK-ELEM-CHAR-16 ( WK-INDICE ) NUMERIC
008760     THEN  MOVE  WK-ELEM-CHAR-16 ( WK-INDICE) TO WK-SUM
008770     ELSE  IF    WK-ELEM-CHAR-16 ( WK-INDICE ) = K1XA
008780           THEN  MOVE  K2U10    TO  WK-SUM
008790           ELSE  IF    WK-ELEM-CHAR-16 ( WK-INDICE ) = K1XB
008800                 THEN  MOVE  K2U11    TO  WK-SUM
008810                 ELSE  IF    WK-ELEM-CHAR-16 ( WK-INDICE ) = K1XC
008820                       THEN  MOVE  K2U12    TO  WK-SUM
008830*     <------------------------------------------------
008840*     <------------------------------------------------
008850*     <------------------------------------------------
008860     ELSE  IF    WK-ELEM-CHAR-16 ( WK-INDICE ) = K1XD
008870           THEN  MOVE  K2U13    TO  WK-SUM
008880           ELSE  IF    WK-ELEM-CHAR-16 ( WK-INDICE ) = K1XE
008890                 THEN  MOVE  K2U14   TO  WK-SUM
008900                 ELSE  MOVE  K2U15   TO  WK-SUM.
008910*
008920     COMPUTE WK-BIN = K2U16 * WK-MULT + WK-SUM.
008930     MOVE    WK-BIN-X     TO  WK-ELEM-CHARX-8 ( WK-INDICE2).
008940     ADD     K1U1     TO WK-INDICE.
008950     ADD     K1U1     TO WK-INDICE2.
008960*
008970 FIN-COMPRIMIR.
008980***************
008990     EXIT.
009000*
009010*
009020*
009030 DESCOMPRIMIR.
009040**************
009050*
           display "XPN-GRNBSDES-DESCOMPRIMIR".

009060     MOVE    WK-ELEM-CHAR-8  ( WK-INDICE )  TO  WK-BIN.
009070     DIVIDE  WK-BIN   BY  K1B16  GIVING WK-DIV
009080             REMAINDER WK-RESTO.
009090     ADD   K1U1                      TO WK-DIV.
009100     MOVE  WK-EL-TAB-CORR (WK-DIV)   TO
009110                               WK-ELEM-CHAR-16 (WK-INDICE2).
009120     ADD   K1U1                      TO WK-INDICE2.
009130     ADD   K1U1                      TO WK-RESTO.
009140     MOVE  WK-EL-TAB-CORR (WK-RESTO) TO
009150                               WK-ELEM-CHAR-16 (WK-INDICE2).
009160     ADD   K1U1                      TO WK-INDICE.
009170     ADD   K1U1                      TO WK-INDICE2.
009180*
009190 FIN-DESCOMPRIMIR.
009200******************
009210     EXIT.
009220*
009230*    SE REALIZA UNA XOR A TRAVES DE LA RUTINA CBL_XOR
009240*
009250 HACER-XOR.
009260***********
009270*
           display "XPN-GRNBSDES-HACER-XOR".

009280     CALL 'CBL_XOR'   USING   WK-BLOQ1-CSS
009290                              WK-BLOQ2-CSS
009300                      BY VALUE 8.
009310*
009320 FIN-HACER-XOR.
009330***************
009340     EXIT.
009350*
009360*    MOVER A DATO AUXILIAR LOS NUMERICOS
009370*
009380 MOVER-NUM.
009390***********
009400*
           display "XPN-GRNBSDES-MOVER-NUM".

009410     IF    WK-ELEM-CHAR-16 ( WK-INDICE ) NUMERIC
009420     THEN  MOVE WK-ELEM-CHAR-16 (WK-INDICE) TO
009430                                 WK-ELEM-AUX(WK-INDICE2)
009440           ADD  K1U1    TO  WK-INDICE2
009450     ELSE  NEXT SENTENCE.
009460*
009470     ADD   K1U1         TO  WK-INDICE.
009480*
009490 FIN-MOVER-NUM.
009500***************
009510     EXIT.
009520*
009530*    MOVER A DATO AUXILIAR LOS ALFABETICOS
009540*
009550 MOVER-ALFA.
009560************
009570*
           display "XPN-GRNBSDES-MOVER-ALFA".

009580     IF    WK-ELEM-CHAR-16 ( WK-INDICE ) NOT NUMERIC
009590     THEN  MOVE WK-ELEM-CHAR-16 (WK-INDICE) TO
009600                                 WK-ELEM-AUX(WK-INDICE2)
009610           ADD  K1U1    TO  WK-INDICE2
009620     ELSE  NEXT SENTENCE.
009630*
009640     ADD   K1U1         TO  WK-INDICE.
009650*
009660 FIN-MOVER-ALFA.
009670***************
009680     EXIT.
      *                                                                 CSSSGM
      *                                                                 CSSSGM
      * ** LEER-TABCLABIN.                                              SAL92320
       LEER-TABINCLBIN.                                                 SAL92320
      ****************                                                  CSSSGM
      *                                                                 CSSSGM
           MOVE  NTABTABINCLBIN          TO   INFO-TABLA.               SAL92320
           MOVE  SPACES                  TO   CLAVE-TABINCLBIN.         SAL92320
           MOVE  WK-PAN-BIN              TO   CLBIBIN.                  CSSSGM
           MOVE  CLAVE-TABINCLBIN        TO   INFO-CLADATO.             SAL92320
           MOVE  DLENTIDAD               TO   INFO-CLAINST.             CSSSGM
           MOVE  K3U102                  TO   INFO-VLI.                 CSSSGM
           MOVE  ZERO                    TO   INFO-CONT.                CSSSGM
      *                                                                 CSSSGM
           display "XPN-GRNBSDES-LEER-TABINCLBIN>" INFO-PDU "]".

           PERFORM CALL-PDU              THRU FIN-CALL-PDU.             CSSSGM
      *                                                                 CSSSGM
JLCJLC     EXHIBIT NAMED 'LEER-TABINCLBIN' IBSTATUS.

           display "XPN-GRNBSDES-LEER-TABINCLBIN<" INFO-PDU "]".

           IF    DLBUEN-ACCESO                                          CSSSGM
           THEN  MOVE  INFO-DATOS        TO   DATOS-TABINCLBIN          SAL92320
           ELSE  IF    DLNOT-DATA                                       CSSSGM
                 THEN  NEXT SENTENCE                                    CSSSGM
                 ELSE  MOVE  MASC1       TO   DLDISPLA-BLOCK            CSSSGM
                       MOVE  K1X2        TO   DLDISPLA-TIPERR           CSSSGM
                       PERFORM DISPLAYAR THRU FIN-DISPLAYAR             CSSSGM
                       MOVE  K4XERRORBD  TO   RUTDES-RESULT             CSSSGM
                       GO TO FIN-RUTINA.                                CSSSGM
      *                                                                 CSSSGM
      * ** FIN-LEER-TABCLABIN.                                          SAL92320
       FIN-LEER-TABINCLBIN.                                             SAL92320
           EXIT.                                                        CSSSGM
      *                                                                 SAL92320
      *                                                                 SAL92320
       LEER-TABINCLENT.                                                 SAL92320
      *****************                                                 SAL92320
      *                                                                 SAL92320
           MOVE  NTABTABINCLENT          TO   INFO-TABLA.               SAL92320
           MOVE  SPACES                  TO   CLAVE-TABINCLENT.         SAL92320
           MOVE  DLPETTCODICAJA          TO   CLBEENTI.                 SAL92320
           MOVE  CLAVE-TABINCLENT        TO   INFO-CLADATO.             SAL92320
           MOVE  DLENTIDAD               TO   INFO-CLAINST.             SAL92320
           MOVE  K3U102                  TO   INFO-VLI.                 SAL92320
           MOVE  ZERO                    TO   INFO-CONT.                SAL92320
      *                                                                 SAL92320
           display "XPN-GRNBSDES-LEER-TABINCLENT>" INFO-PDU "]".

           PERFORM CALL-PDU              THRU FIN-CALL-PDU.             SAL92320
      *                                                                 SAL92320
JLCJLC     EXHIBIT NAMED 'LEER-TABINCLENT' IBSTATUS.

           display "XPN-GRNBSDES-LEER-TABINCLENT<" INFO-PDU "]".

           IF    DLBUEN-ACCESO                                          SAL92320
           THEN  MOVE  INFO-DATOS        TO   DATOS-TABINCLENT          SAL92320
           ELSE  IF    DLNOT-DATA                                       SAL92320
                 THEN  NEXT SENTENCE                                    SAL92320
                 ELSE  MOVE  MASC2       TO   DLDISPLA-BLOCK            SAL92320
                       MOVE  K1X2        TO   DLDISPLA-TIPERR           SAL92320
                       PERFORM DISPLAYAR THRU FIN-DISPLAYAR             SAL92320
                       MOVE  K4XERRORBD  TO   RUTDES-RESULT             SAL92320
                       GO TO FIN-RUTINA.                                SAL92320
      *                                                                 SAL92320
       FIN-LEER-TABINCLENT.                                             SAL92320
           EXIT.                                                        SAL92320
      *
       LEER-PARAM.                                                 
      ************                                                  
      *            
           display "XPN-GRNBSDES-LEER-PARAM".
                                                     
           MOVE  NTABPARAMETROS          TO   INFO-TABLA.              
           MOVE  AREAGOLF                TO   PART-AREA.                
           MOVE  PART-AREA               TO   INFO-CLADATO.             SAL92320
           MOVE  ZEROS                   TO   INFO-CLAINST.             CSSSGM
           MOVE  K3U202                  TO   INFO-VLI.                 CSSSGM
           MOVE  ZERO                    TO   INFO-CONT.                CSSSGM
      *                                                                 CSSSGM
           PERFORM CALL-PDU              THRU FIN-CALL-PDU.             CSSSGM
      *                                                                 CSSSGM
           IF    DLBUEN-ACCESO                                          CSSSGM
           THEN  MOVE  INFO-DATOS        TO   DATOS-PARAMETROS          
           ELSE  MOVE  MASC3             TO   DLDISPLA-BLOCK            
                 MOVE  K1X2              TO   DLDISPLA-TIPERR           
                 PERFORM DISPLAYAR       THRU FIN-DISPLAYAR             
                 MOVE  K4XERRORBD        TO   RUTDES-RESULT            
                 GO TO FIN-RUTINA.                                
      *                                                                 
       FIN-LEER-PARAM.                                             
           EXIT.                                                        
